{{define "content"}}
<section class="intro">
  <h1>Matthew Weekes</h1>
  <p class="tagline">Software developer, self-hoster, and privacy advocate.</p>
  <p>
    Welcome to <a href="/">medidew.name</a>. If your first thoughts upon seeing
    this home page were: "wow, this looks about as bland as a Wikipedia page,"
    then I thank you very much. I don't like flashy websites. Besides, even if
    UI and UX were my forte, which they very much are not, I would rather your
    attention lay with the contents of my words than on a fancy animation that
    obscures half of what you want to read, eats unnecessary resources, and
    makes most of the page impossible to search.
  </p>

  <p>
    No, I've not been wronged by professional web design before. Whatever gave
    you that impression?
  </p>

  <p>
    So what is this website for? Well, I have a lot of things I want to share
    &mdash; a lot of projects, essays, opinions, and reviews &mdash; but I've chosen
    to keep most of those private over the years. I've never been big on the
    social media platforms that everyone else uses, a feeling that has only
    strengthened with the advent of TikTok and YouTube Shorts and such. But
    even then, most of the stuff I make is primarily for myself. Up until now,
    I've never felt the need to share it.
  </p>

  <p>
    However, every now and then it's both useful and convenient to have
    something concrete to point to when I'm talking about an app I wrote, or
    maybe a film I once watched. Thus, at its core, this website is a hub for
    those 'somethings'. Perhaps alongside the occasional ramble.
  </p>

  <p>
    That, and considering I originally bought the domain for my self-hosting
    escapades, I thought it would be a waste not to make full use of it. Who
    doesn't want to run their very own website?
  </p>
</section>

<hr>

<section class="recent-posts">
  <h2>Recent posts</h2>
  {{if .Recent}}
  <ul class="post-list">
    {{range .Recent}}
    <li>
      <a href="/blog/{{.Slug}}">{{.Title}}</a>
      <span class="meta">{{.Date.Format "Jan 2, 2006"}}</span>
    </li>
    {{end}}
  </ul>
  <p><a href="/blog">more posts &rarr;</a></p>
  {{else}}
  <p>Nothing posted yet &mdash; check back soon.</p>
  {{end}}
</section>

{{end}}
